OL,3,GNEWSAGroup of 60 attacked pub with
OL,4,Afireworks, landlady says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landlady said she locked customers
OL,7,Finside her pub for hours while a group
OL,8,Fof youths attacked it with fireworks.
OL,10,FSalford pub manager Paula, 61, said she
OL,11,Fand 30 customers hid out as "about 60
OL,12,Fteenagers" bombarded The Plough, in
OL,13,FCadishead, on Saturday
OL,15,FPolice were called, and footage from
OL,16,Fthe incident, appearing to show doors
OL,17,Fbeing kicked and a bus driver being
OL,18,Fassaulted, has since been shared on
OL,19,Fsocial media.
OL,21,F"It was very scary. I'm worried they
OL,22,Fwill come back," Paula said.
